napkin 1
# The Pencil as a script draws with it: graphite grades alone, a medium and
# its grade, and a colored pencil. Each line is the lead through the paper's
# grain, in its tone; the SVG carries the paper's tooth once, and a grain
# paint for each pencil.
page 520 280
name "pencil"
background #fcfaf5
layer "Pencils"
width 3
pencil 2H
line 20 30 500 30
pencil HB
line 20 60 500 60
pencil 6B
line 20 90 500 90
width 4
pencil charcoal 4B
line 20 130 500 130
width 7
pencil vine soft
line 20 170 500 170
width 6
pencil compressed 6B
line 20 210 500 210
width 3
pencil 2B #3b6e8f
line 20 250 500 250
